 04 - J.A.I.S.S. Architecture

## Gene-Based Weight Kernels
J.A.I.S.S. replaces traditional scalar weights with structured gene expressions. Each weight kernel possesses activation thresholds, mutation metrics, and historical retention tags.

## Neural Receptor Pipelines
Inputs are processed through localized resonance gates that evaluate incoming stimulus against active gene profiles, triggering dynamic expression shifts rather than static forward-pass multiplications.
